WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Every change arrives as a pull request.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.600
The PR workflows run in parallel: tests and build, CodeQL, dependencies, supply chain, security and labels.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.000
After a manual review, the merge goes to main.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.600
Cloudflare deploys the site (Pages) and the Worker (Workers Builds).

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.200
After every deploy, production is checked: the headers and the Worker's routes.
